    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_steps_body",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 348,
      "height": 148,
      "text": "1. Hash binding  H(coordPubKey), H(newPubKey),\n   H(c1), H(c2), H(sharedKey), H(d1), H(d2)\n\n2. Nullifier  =  Poseidon(domain, oldPrivKey, pollId)\n   → prevents double registration\n\n3. Deactivate leaf  =  Poseidon(domain, c1H, c2H, skH)\n   → proves old key was deactivated\n\n4. Merkle inclusion  rebuild root from leaf + path\n   assert(root == deactivateRootHash)\n\n5. Re-randomization binding  d1/d2 valid re-rand of c1/c2\n\n6. inputHash  aggregates all public fields",
      "originalText": "1. Hash binding  H(coordPubKey), H(newPubKey),\n   H(c1), H(c2), H(sharedKey), H(d1), H(d2)\n\n2. Nullifier  =  Poseidon(domain, oldPrivKey, pollId)\n   → prevents double registration\n\n3. Deactivate leaf  =  Poseidon(domain, c1H, c2H, skH)\n   → proves old key was deactivated\n\n4. Merkle inclusion  rebuild root from leaf + path\n   assert(root == deactivateRootHash)\n\n5. Re-randomization binding  d1/d2 valid re-rand of c1/c2\n\n6. inputHash  aggregates all public fields",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
